{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SsfReceiver"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Poll the stream’s RFC 8936 endpoint, "},{"code":"{base URL}\/ssf\/v1\/poll\/{stream_id}","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", with a bearer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from the configured "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SsfReceiverConfiguration\/accessTokenProvider"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Method","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK11SsfReceiverC4poll8streamID7optionsAA0C10PollResultVSS_AA0cI7OptionsVtYaKF","symbolKind":"method","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"poll","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"streamID","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"options","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK14SsfPollOptionsV","text":"SsfPollOptions","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK13SsfPollResultV","text":"SsfPollResult","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"title":"poll(streamID:options:)"},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SsfReceiver\/poll(streamID:options:)"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"poll"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"streamID"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"options"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"SsfPollOptions","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK14SsfPollOptionsV","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SsfPollOptions"},{"kind":"text","text":" = SsfPollOptions()) "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"SsfPollResult","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK13SsfPollResultV","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SsfPollResult"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ack"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"setErrs"},{"type":"text","text":" are sent exactly as given. "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Nothing is acknowledged on your","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"behalf","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": acknowledge, on the next call, the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"jti"},{"type":"text","text":"s you processed, and pass each refused"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"setErrs"},{"type":"text","text":" ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SetErr(reason:)"},{"type":"text","text":"). A SET you neither acknowledge nor refuse is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"re-offered — and, having been recorded when it verified, then reads as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"replayed"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Retried per §16 on a transport failure, "},{"code":"408","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"429","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"code":"5xx","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"; never on another "},{"code":"4xx","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which maps as the management surface maps it ("},{"code":"400","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is a "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/NetworkError","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/NetworkError\/isValidation","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" set, "},{"code":"404","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AuthzError","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"…)."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"A failure that is not a verdict never costs an event","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (CONTRACT.md §34.2 P1). A key"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"fetch that fails, or a replay store that cannot answer, stops the batch at that SET:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the SETs already verified are returned in "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SsfPollResult\/events"},{"type":"text","text":" (they are recorded),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and that SET and every later one are listed in "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SsfPollResult\/unjudged"},{"type":"text","text":" —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"unrecorded, neither acknowledge nor refuse them, and the transmitter offers them again."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"When no SET of the batch was accepted, nothing is recorded and the failure is thrown"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"instead. A SET refused "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"replayed"},{"type":"text","text":" was accepted by this receiver earlier: acknowledge it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ack"},{"type":"text","text":" rather than reporting it in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"setErrs"},{"type":"text","text":" (§34.2 P2). A "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"poll"},{"type":"text","text":" that returns leaving"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"SETs unjudged emits "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/TelemetryEvent\/ssfUnjudged(operation:count:category:)"},{"type":"text","text":" (§19.1)."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"a local "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AuthError","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" when no access-token provider is configured."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note","name":"Throws","type":"aside"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/ssfreceiver\/poll(streamid:options:)"]}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/SsfPollResult/events":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"events"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK13SecurityEventV","text":"SecurityEvent"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SsfPollResult\/events","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/ssfpollresult\/events","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The SETs that verified — each one recorded in the replay store."}],"title":"events"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk","role":"collection","title":"AxiamSDK","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text